## Table 1: clean baseline

| task | correct | llm_calls | tokens | latency_s (observed) | api_backoff_s | latency_minus_backoff_s |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| T1 | 1 | 27 | 32005 | 38.9 | 0.0 | 38.9 |
| T2 | 1 | 19 | 22321 | 31.7 | 0.0 | 31.7 |
